@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083
@customerId = 2

### 1. Crear un pedido con 2 productos (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": {{customerId}},
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 2. Listar pedidos (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders

### 3. Consultar el pedido 1 (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1

### 4. Cliente que no existe (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 999,
  "items": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### 5. Stock insuficiente (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": {{customerId}},
  "items": [ { "productId": 2, "quantity": 100 } ]
}

### 6. Producto que no existe (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": {{customerId}},
  "items": [ { "productId": 999, "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### 7. Pedido sin productos (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": {{customerId}},
  "items": []
}

### 8. Cambiar estado a IN_DELIVERY (200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "IN_DELIVERY" }

### 9. Cambio no permitido: volver a CREATED (409)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CREATED" }